        <mxCell id="legend" value="LINK LEGEND  |  Blue solid: IPsec VPN + BGP   /   Gray dashed: VNet peering   /   Green solid: Private Link&lt;br&gt;Old on-prem and GCP tunnels to West Europe are not in the target transit path. Sweden has no VPN gateway in this view. Firewall presence does not imply inspection." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=15;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="988" width="1820" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
